# Architecture

## Layers

| Layer | Location | Responsibility |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Routes / pages | `app/` | Composition, metadata, routing only |
| UI | `components/` | Presentational + interactive UI |
| Hooks | `hooks/` | Client state/effects reusable across UI |
| Domain types | `types/` | Shared contracts |
| Pure logic | `lib/` | Helpers, constants, mappers, validators |

## Patterns

- Keep components focused; extract when a file mixes data shaping + heavy UI.
- Prefer composition over prop drilling; lift state only as needed.
- Side effects (fetch, storage, timers) live in hooks or server modules — not in presentational leaves.
- Validate external data at boundaries (`unknown` → typed).
- Avoid god components and circular imports.
- Feature folders under `components/` by domain (e.g. `landing/`, later `auth/`, `tests/`).
